event TickUpdated(int24 tick, int128 liquidityDelta, bool initialized);

function update(...) internal returns (bool flipped) {
    ...
    emit TickUpdated(tick, liquidityDelta, info.initialized);
}
By emitting such an event, you enhance the system’s transparency, which is crucial for both security audits and user trust in decentralized applications.


